%% Diagram 12: Firebase Token and Secure Session Flow Topology — OopsieEats
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pengguna as 👤 Pengguna
    participant App as 📱 OopsieEats App (Flutter)
    participant FSS as 🔐 FlutterSecureStorage (KeyStore)
    participant Auth as 🛡️ Firebase Auth
    participant DB as 🔥 Cloud Firestore (Rules)

    Pengguna->>App: Masukkan Kredensial (Email/Password atau Google Sign-In)
    App->>Auth: Kirim Permintaan Autentikasi (OAuth 2.0 / Password)
    Auth-->>App: Respon Sukses: ID Token (JWT), Refresh Token, UID
    App->>FSS: Enkripsi & Simpan Sesi (UID, Role, Refresh Token)
    Note over App,FSS: Kunci sesi dilindungi AES-256 GCM pada hardware KeyStore/Keychain

    Pengguna->>App: Buka Dashboard / Riwayat Makan
    App->>DB: Kueri Firestore users/{uid}/meals (Sertakan ID Token gRPC)
    DB->>DB: Evaluasi Aturan firestore.rules: request.auth.uid == userId
    alt Token Sah & UID Cocok
        DB-->>App: Kembalikan Data Dokumen & Stream Snapshot
        App-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan Data Asupan Gizi di Layar
    else Token Kedaluwarsa (Expired)
        App->>Auth: Minta Refresh Token Baru di Latar Belakang
        Auth-->>App: Terbitkan ID Token Baru
        App->>DB: Ulangi Kueri Data dengan Token Baru
    else Percobaan Akses Dokumen Pengguna Lain (UID Tidak Cocok)
        DB-->>App: Error: PERMISSION_DENIED (Akses Ditolak)
        App-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan Pesan Keamanan
    end
